 "note_b16b": "B16b raw files under the same raw root; the decoded sample arrays of pts1 (a-samples.npy, b-samples.npy) are intermediate and not evidence",
 "note_b16c": "B16c adds bcrf/ and baaf/: both taps, McASP0's recording, the external capture, lane B6's loop, the console poll and the tone monitor, each rechecked against its run's own record before listing",
 "note_r2": "Round 2 adds source/: the tone source's twelve read-only reads (meters observed passively; a state read adds the source's one documented read request), copied unchanged from the lane's private store; r2/source-receipt.json reduces them",
 "note_r3": "Round 3 adds playback/: the tone playback's two retained logs (lanes B16 and B16c), copied unchanged from the lane's private store; r3/playback-logs.json reduces them. Lane B16b's log was overwritten when lane B16c started the playback and is not retained"
}
